  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Second electron gain enthalpy is always positive for every element because to overcome repulsion between an anion and electron,&nbsp; energy has to be supplied.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>O</mi> <mo>&#8722;</mo> </msup> <mo>+</mo><msup> <mi>e</mi> <mo>&#8722;</mo> </msup> <mo>&#8594;</mo><msup> <mi>O</mi> <mrow> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </msup> <mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#916;</mi><msub> <mi>H</mi> <mrow> <mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow> </math></p></blockquote>",
